WEBVTT

00:03:27.877 --> 00:03:30.513
chunki ba'zan
odamzot inson bo'lishni hohlaydi.

00:03:30.513 --> 00:03:32.733
U ayolga esa, o'quvchilarim 
shunchalik zukkoki

00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:35.120
hatto Toroning transendentalizmini 
tushunishadi,

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.245
"Wire" seryalining 
bir qismini ko'rdim deb

00:03:37.245 --> 00:03:39.550
bolalarni bilaman deb oylamang, deyman.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.915
Bu yil nimadandir voz kechish o'rniga

00:03:43.515 --> 00:03:47.498
har kunimni tilim ostida mikrofon

00:03:47.998 --> 00:03:50.855
qo'yilgan kabi yashayman,
qo'rquvim ostida minbar bor kabi.

00:03:52.122 --> 00:03:57.845
Chunki, sizda ovoz bor ekan,
jamoa minbariga hech xojat yo'q!

00:03:57.845 --> 00:03:58.768
Rahmat.

00:03:58.768 --> 00:04:04.797
(Qarsaklar)